      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Ibn Abu Umeyr, from Hammad, from Al Halby, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup>, said, ‘I asked him<sup>asws</sup> about the man who emancipates the slave girl, and he is saying, ‘Your dower is your emancipation’. So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Good’."
        ]
